<title>NETHERLANDS: Stad R'dam details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Stad R'dam details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer Stad Rotterdam said on Monday it had set the stock part of its 1996 optional final dividend at one new share per 110 held.</p>
<p>In April, it announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.38 guilders, of which 0.94 guilders had already been paid as an interim dividend. The final payment could be taken up fully in cash or as an alternative dividend of 0.74 guilders in cash plus a part in new shares.</p>
<p>Stad Rotterdam's shares closed at 80.90 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday, up 1.10 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
